                              "type": "paragraph",
                              "attrs": {},
                              "content": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "text": "Dabrafenib 50 mg and 75 mg capsules in combination with trametinib 0.5 mg and 2 mg tablets for treating locally advanced or metastatic anaplastic thyroid cancer in patients with a BRAF V600 mutation and with no satisfactory locoregional treatment options."
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "hardBreak"
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
