                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Dabrafenib 50 mg and 75 mg capsules and trametinib 0.5 mg and 2 mg tablets are recommended for inclusion on the Medication Assistance Fund (MAF) for the abovementioned indication with effect from 4 January 2022."
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "marks": [
